<p>God, this was such a fun article to read, especially the way the statcraft is made. I would have loved it more if you changed the aliens in ST a bit more representable rather than the stupid &quot;humanoid-ancestor&quot; crap. I was about to upload a bunch of pics to Youtube and deviantart to show the physiological and meta-phonological properties of the Vulcans, Klingons, Cardassians, Andronians, ect. but Roddenbury was a good universe creator yet had horrifically bigoted writers on board to sterotype humanity. I would justify the Gene is somewhere in Writers Limbo where he is still taking praiss and disgust from his creation.</p>

